--- an alias of a DateTime expression with the name of a DateTime column
1
event = toDateTime(\'2020-01-01 00:00:00\', \'Asia/Tokyo\')
2
--- an alias that refers to another alias with the name of a column
event = \'2020-01-01 00:00:00\')
1
--- an alias with another precision than the column
2
--- an alias of a tuple with another precision of an element than the column
2
--- the same for MergeTree
n.ts = toDateTime64(\'2020-01-01 00:00:00\', 3, \'Asia/Tokyo\')))
2
--- aliases inside the expression of an alias with the name of a column
3
